# Always commit and push updates

After making changes to this repo (especially `mine.lua`), always:

1. Commit the changes with a concise message matching the existing style
2. Push to `origin/main` so the turtle can download with:

```shell
wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ntimpson/mine.lua/main/mine.lua mine
```

Do not leave turtle script updates only on the local machine.
